 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Try not to take it personally. She's just concerned about you. Ask her to help you clean together. Then only share what feels comfortable. Say you'd love her help, but only if she respects boundaries. Offer to show her how you organize things. She might surprise you. People often enjoy teaching when they see you' genuinely interested. Let her lead and be as helps as you can be. Then find time together that's just the two of you, and talk about it. She might surprise you. She wants to help, and together you can show her how you like things without compromising.",
